Error [E0201]: `ExpiringSecret.new` needs the move marker `^` here — this value can't be copied
  --> expiring_secret_requires_ownership_and_rejects_loan_escape.jet:10:35
    |
 10 |     _ := vault.ExpiringSecret.new(key, ttl, clock)
    |                                   ^^^
 Why: Parameter 1 takes ownership through the move marker `^`; passing `key` without that marker would have to copy it, but this type can't be copied
 Fix: Write the move marker `^` (`^key`) to move ownership to `ExpiringSecret.new`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201
